1. MODEL WEIGHTS
==============================================================================

The GGUF model weights described in pagex/models_manifest.json are NOT part
of the PageX source repository or of any PageX binary/wheel/docker image;
they are fetched at runtime with `pagex models download` or installed
offline with `pagex models install-pack <zip>`. When downloaded, each weight
file is redistributed under the license of its upstream model:

  model                              upstream repository                 license
  ---------------------------------  ----------------------------------  ----------
  Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct               lmstudio-community/                Apache-2.0
    (VLM, Q4_K_M + mmproj F16)       Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct-GGUF
  Qwen2.5-VL-3B-Instruct             ggml-org/                          Apache-2.0
    (VLM alternate, Q4_K_M + mmproj) Qwen2.5-VL-3B-Instruct-GGUF
  granite-3.3-2b-instruct            unsloth/                           Apache-2.0
    (chat / assembly LLM, Q4_K_M)    granite-3.3-2b-instruct-GGUF
  Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct              Qwen/                              Apache-2.0
    (tier-2 fallback LLM, Q4_K_M)    Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-GGUF
  all-MiniLM-L6-v2                   Mungert/                           Apache-2.0
    (embedder, Q4)                   all-MiniLM-L6-v2-GGUF
  bge-small-en-v1.5                  ggml-org/                          MIT
    (embedder fallback, Q8_0)        bge-small-en-v1.5-Q8_0-GGUF

All BGE (BGE = BAAI General Embedding) models are published by BAAI under
the MIT license (verified on the BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 model card); the
Qwen, granite and MiniLM weights are Apache-2.0. Apache-2.0 requires that
this NOTICE be included when those weights are redistributed (for example
inside an offline demo pack - see packaging/make_demo_pack.py).

